{"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"YubiKit"}],"roleHeading":"Article","role":"article","title":"Logging"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/yubikit\/loggingguide"]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/LoggingGuide","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"No setup is required. YubiKit defaults to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"debug"},{"text":" on stdout when compiled with ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DEBUG"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"info"},{"text":" on stderr otherwise. You can override either default:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["import YubiKit","import Logging","","\/\/ Show warnings and errors.","YubiKit.Logs.configure(logLevel: .warning)","","\/\/ Use your preferred backend.","YubiKit.Logs.configure(logLevel: .debug) { label in","    StreamLogHandler.standardOutput(label: label)","}","","\/\/ Turn logging off.","YubiKit.Logs.configure { _ in SwiftLogNoOpLogHandler() }","","\/\/ Restore defaults.","YubiKit.Logs.configure()"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Add ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/apple\/swift-log","type":"reference"},{"text":"’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Logging"},{"text":" product to your app target","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to use its backend types. Any SwiftLog ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LogHandler"},{"text":" can be supplied by the factory.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Each call replaces both settings. Omitting the factory restores YubiKit’s backend;","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"omitting the level uses the selected handler’s level. Changes apply to existing sessions,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"though logs already in progress may use the previous settings.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"YubiKit’s configuration does not affect other libraries. To share your app’s backend,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"pass its factory explicitly; global ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LoggingSystem.bootstrap"},{"text":" does not select YubiKit’s backend.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Factories may run concurrently and must not log through YubiKit themselves.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Traffic logging","level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Traffic-logging"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["YubiKit.Logs.configure(logLevel: .trace)"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Raw traffic and SCP plaintext logs require ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"YubiKit to be compiled with ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DEBUG"}]},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Neither configuration nor a custom backend can enable them in other builds.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Custom connections are responsible for their own traffic logging.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"name":"Warning","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Debug logs can include account names and credential identifiers.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Trace logs can include PINs, credentials, and cryptographic keys. Protect or redact logs before sharing them.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside","style":"warning"},{"text":"Custom backends","level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Custom-backends"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Labels identify categories, such as ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"com.yubico.YubiKit.OATH"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"com.yubico.Yu